<title>UK: Oresund sets 350 mln DKK domestic eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Oresund sets 350 mln DKK domestic eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oresundsforbindelsen has issued a 350 million Danish drown eight-year domestic bond, joint lead managers CIBC Wood Gundy and Nykredit said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The issue price and fees were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The Copenhagen-listed notes, due January 29, 2005, are guaranteed by Denmark.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
